# Anchored to repo root (leading /) — an unanchored `attachments` pattern
# matches at ANY depth, which was silently excluding the real, tracked
# src/app/api/attachments/ route from git entirely since the file was
# created (confirmed via `git log --all -- src/app/api/attachments/`
# returning nothing, and reproducing the resulting CI build/typecheck
# failure in an isolated worktree — see CHANGELOG.md). This line is only
# meant to exclude the runtime upload-storage folder at repo root.
/attachments
backups/
*.log
